# SITE_ADDRESS is the hostname list Caddy serves. It is one name today:
#   voiceai.specificityinc.com
# APP_URL stays https://voiceai.specificityinc.com. Do not rename it here.
# There is no NEXTAUTH_URL and no cookie Domain. The session cookie stays
# host-only (voiceops_session).
#
# jarvis.specificityinc.com has no DNS record yet. Do not put that name in
# the active site block until the A record exists, or certificate issuance
# can take the working site down with it.
#
# Once the A record for jarvis.specificityinc.com points at this server,
# set SITE_ADDRESS (in the server env, not in this repo) to both names:
#   jarvis.specificityinc.com, voiceai.specificityinc.com
# Canonical sign-in is https://jarvis.specificityinc.com/login.
# The app redirects other public-host pages there. /api and webhooks stay
# on the host that received them.
{$SITE_ADDRESS} {
	reverse_proxy app:43123
}
